#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:116
msgid "Installation of Cogl"
msgstr "Instalação do <quote>Cogl</quote>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:127
msgid ""
"Install <application>Cogl</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Cogl</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:133
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr  \\\n"
"            --enable-gles1 \\\n"
"            --enable-gles2 \\\n"
"            --enable-{kms,wayland,xlib}-egl-platform \\\n"
"            --enable-wayland-egl-server              &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr   \\\n"
"            --enable-gles1 \\\n"
"            --enable-gles2 \\\n"
"            --enable-{kms,wayland,xlib}-egl-platform \\\n"
"            --enable-wayland-egl-server              &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#.  I found this on my system with an NVIDIA GPU, but running the tests
#.            on an 11.3 system with an Intel GPU provides the same results.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:141
msgid ""
"All of the tests except for the ES2 and ES2-NPT tests are broken due to "
"slight behavior changes in Mesa. To test the results anyway, issue: "
"<command>make check</command>. The tests should be run from an X terminal on"
" a hardware accelerated Xorg Server. A few tests will use all CPUs in "
"parallel, regardless of parallellism settings."
msgstr ""
"Todos os testes, exceto os testes ES2 e ES2-NPT, estão quebrados devido a "
"pequenas mudanças de comportamento no Mesa. Para testar os resultados de "
"qualquer maneira, emita: <command>make check</command>. Os testes deveriam "
"ser executados a partir de um terminal do X em um servidor Xorg acelerado "
"por hardware. Uns poucos testes usarão todas as CPUs em paralelo, "
"independentemente das configurações de paralelismo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:151
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:159
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações dos Comandos"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:162
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-gles1</parameter>: This switch enables support for "
"OpenGL ES 1.1."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-gles1</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o suporte para "
"&quot;OpenGL ES 1.1&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:167
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-gles2</parameter>: This switch enables support for "
"OpenGL ES 2.0."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-gles2</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o suporte para "
"&quot;OpenGL ES 2.0&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:172
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-{kms,wayland,xlib}-egl-platform</parameter>: These "
"switches enable support for KMS, Wayland and Xlib EGL platforms.  They are "
"required for <application>GNOME</application> Wayland support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-{kms,wayland,xlib}-egl-platform</parameter>: Essas "
"chaves habilitam o suporte para plataformas &quot;EGL&quot; &quot;KMS&quot;,"
" &quot;Wayland&quot; e &quot;Xlib&quot;. Elas são exigidas para o suporte do"
" &quot;Wayland&quot; do &quot;<application>GNOME</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:178
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-wayland-egl-server</parameter>: This switch enables "
"<application>Cogl</application>'s Wayland Server API which is required for "
"<application>GNOME</application> Wayland support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-wayland-egl-server</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"&quot;API&quot; do Servidor &quot;Wayland&quot; do "
"&quot;<application>Cogl</application>&quot;, que é exigida para o suporte do"
" &quot;Wayland&quot; do &quot;<application>GNOME</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/cogl.xml:184
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-cogl-gst</option>: This switch enables gstreamer support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-cogl-gst</option>: Essa chave habilita o suporte ao "
"&quot;gstreamer&quot;."

